WEBVTT

00:00:00.430 --> 00:00:03.720
That is Laplace's Box.

00:00:07.800 --> 00:00:15.930
The true form of the curse that has kept
us spellbound these long hundred years.

00:00:16.470 --> 00:00:19.510
The final location
indicated by the La+ Program

00:00:19.550 --> 00:00:22.800
is Industrial 7's Magallanica.

00:00:22.840 --> 00:00:26.970
Waiting for Banagher and Mineva
in a cold sleep room at the Vist mansion

00:00:27.010 --> 00:00:32.260
is Banagher's great-grandfather Syam Vist,
the founding head of the Vist family.

00:00:33.220 --> 00:00:38.050
Syam participated in the terror attack
at the inception of the Universal Century,

00:00:38.090 --> 00:00:42.760
and turned the Universal Century charter
that he obtained, into Laplace's Box,

00:00:42.800 --> 00:00:45.550
using it to
manipulate the Earth Federation government,

00:00:45.590 --> 00:00:49.760
creating the present status quo.

00:00:50.590 --> 00:00:56.180
"In the future, should the emergence of a
new space-adapted human race be confirmed,

00:00:56.220 --> 00:00:58.260
the Earth Federation shall give
priority to involving them

00:00:58.340 --> 00:01:00.300
in the administration of the government."

00:01:01.550 --> 00:01:03.680
- A new human race...
- Newtypes?

00:01:04.010 --> 00:01:06.590
What do you desire?

00:01:07.130 --> 00:01:10.550
What do you wish for in your heart?

00:01:10.590 --> 00:01:11.760
In people.

00:01:12.180 --> 00:01:16.130
In the possibility that humanity possesses.

00:01:17.180 --> 00:01:20.510
Having received the Box from Syam,
Banagher decides to use it on

00:01:20.550 --> 00:01:23.840
behalf of the futures of everyone
in the Earthsphere.

00:01:24.470 --> 00:01:29.760
Full Frontal reappears, declaring himself
the representative for all Spacenoids.

00:01:29.800 --> 00:01:33.720
As such, he claims to be
the proper inheritor of the Box.

00:01:33.760 --> 00:01:39.300
I will take the Charter of the
Universal Century by force.

00:01:49.510 --> 00:01:52.430
He truly is a ghost...

00:01:52.930 --> 00:01:56.510
You are up against Full Frontal.
Don't let your guard down.

00:01:56.680 --> 00:01:58.800
And now, the time has come

00:01:58.840 --> 00:02:03.010
for the final duel
between Banagher and Full Frontal.

00:02:03.050 --> 00:02:04.300
Banagher!

00:02:05.840 --> 00:02:08.340
I'll be back! Count on it!

00:03:42.130 --> 00:03:46.880
(TO THE WORLD'S END)

00:04:00.380 --> 00:04:02.930
Commander! Please fire!

00:04:04.510 --> 00:04:06.180
Commander!

00:04:24.380 --> 00:04:26.380
Fall back!
This thing is dangerous!

00:04:33.840 --> 00:04:37.090
I can't sense any hostility...
It's just a program?

00:04:51.090 --> 00:04:52.430
I'm in a hurry.

00:05:21.130 --> 00:05:22.880
Master Banagher, are you injured?

00:05:23.380 --> 00:05:24.630
I'm fine!

00:05:24.680 --> 00:05:26.010
Hurry to the Unicorn!

00:05:31.380 --> 00:05:33.260
Inheritor of the Box.

00:05:34.340 --> 00:05:37.260
I must warn you that you
will not get past me.

00:05:39.430 --> 00:05:40.430
We'll force our way through!

00:06:14.260 --> 00:06:15.180
Don't!

00:06:15.220 --> 00:06:16.590
Fall back!

00:06:16.630 --> 00:06:19.800
Your father had a dream.

00:06:19.840 --> 00:06:22.720
One of building a new world
in a future where

00:06:22.760 --> 00:06:24.680
the Box had been opened.

00:06:46.300 --> 00:06:47.930
What brought you here

00:06:47.970 --> 00:06:50.380
was your own free will.

00:06:50.430 --> 00:06:52.720
Not some curse.

00:07:05.340 --> 00:07:06.880
Continue onward, never wavering...

00:07:08.340 --> 00:07:11.380
You are your father's...

00:07:12.630 --> 00:07:15.260
Unicorn!

00:07:50.970 --> 00:07:51.970
Mas...

00:07:53.180 --> 00:07:54.680
Master...

00:08:25.630 --> 00:08:26.800
Frontal!

00:08:30.260 --> 00:08:33.010
It's the Gundam!
I heard Banagher's voice!

00:08:33.050 --> 00:08:35.470
That damn Frontal...
All this with one machine?

00:08:35.510 --> 00:08:37.300
Enemy movement?

00:08:37.340 --> 00:08:39.970
None! No sign of
reinforcements, either!

00:08:40.010 --> 00:08:43.050
Still, that's no ordinary machine!

00:08:43.090 --> 00:08:45.260
Can't the mobile suits
launch to assist?

00:08:45.930 --> 00:08:48.720
Ensign Riddhe! The Banshee appears
to be engaging the enemy!

00:09:03.840 --> 00:09:04.970
Mr. Riddhe!

00:09:10.430 --> 00:09:14.720
Let's do this, Banagher.
This light isn't coming only from us.

00:09:15.630 --> 00:09:16.840
I know.

00:09:17.430 --> 00:09:19.470
Everyone is inside it.

00:09:31.340 --> 00:09:34.090
Light that emanates from people.

00:09:34.130 --> 00:09:36.550
Those who hold this warmth, they all...

00:09:37.930 --> 00:09:39.260
It's all for nothing.

00:09:44.180 --> 00:09:49.260
I wonder, what sort of future
will all this give rise to?

00:09:49.930 --> 00:09:53.260
It's possible that nothing
at all will change.

00:09:54.050 --> 00:09:56.720
Words are nothing more than words.

00:09:56.760 --> 00:10:01.260
Even laws are interpreted in whatever
manner best suits people's interests.

00:10:02.260 --> 00:10:08.720
Naturally, if the Box is opened, there
will be some commotion for a while.

00:10:08.760 --> 00:10:14.010
There might be a movement
to enforce that article.

00:10:14.050 --> 00:10:19.090
But do Newtypes actually exist
in the first place?

00:10:19.880 --> 00:10:24.800
After all the debate and investigation,

00:10:24.840 --> 00:10:30.090
a definitive conclusion
will never be reached.

00:10:30.800 --> 00:10:32.090
Even so.

00:10:32.720 --> 00:10:36.260
Even so, Banagher will do
what he believes is right.

00:10:37.220 --> 00:10:40.840
Just like the people who etched
their sincere goodwill

00:10:40.880 --> 00:10:43.010
into this monument a century ago.

00:10:44.340 --> 00:10:46.970
Just as you have done by
protecting this monument

00:10:47.010 --> 00:10:50.260
so that their goodwill could
be made known to us now.

00:10:51.430 --> 00:10:55.050
He has found a good partner.

00:10:57.180 --> 00:10:58.800
Princess Mineva.

00:10:59.260 --> 00:11:04.630
I would like the world to hear
the truth from your lips.

00:11:04.680 --> 00:11:08.010
Tell our only desire

00:11:08.050 --> 00:11:12.300
to the people living in
the Universal Century.

00:11:12.340 --> 00:11:15.300
In your own words.

00:11:54.590 --> 00:11:57.220
So, two Gundams oppose me?

00:11:57.260 --> 00:12:00.340
Me, the vessel filled with the
collective will of the people!

00:12:00.680 --> 00:12:02.090
A vessel?

00:12:02.130 --> 00:12:05.630
Humans can't be vessels,
not even artificial ones!

00:12:05.680 --> 00:12:09.340
Spit out everything that's under
that mask, Full Frontal!

00:12:09.800 --> 00:12:13.180
Very well, I accept
your challenge, Gundams!

00:12:31.840 --> 00:12:32.880
Wha- -?

00:12:33.260 --> 00:12:35.380
Frontal, what are you- -?!

00:12:45.590 --> 00:12:46.760
Mr. Riddhe!

00:12:58.010 --> 00:12:59.510
Even so!

00:13:00.180 --> 00:13:01.340
Banagher!

00:13:02.840 --> 00:13:04.340
Banagher!

00:13:05.470 --> 00:13:06.590
Ensign!

00:13:09.840 --> 00:13:11.340
Ensign Riddhe...

00:14:29.010 --> 00:14:32.300
The miracle is repeating itself...

00:14:32.930 --> 00:14:37.510
And nothing will change.
Look, Banagher!

00:15:56.880 --> 00:15:59.510
This is where it all began.

00:15:59.970 --> 00:16:02.840
So, you can see it as well.

00:16:02.880 --> 00:16:08.010
In that case, let us travel together to the
end of time in this universe, Banagher!

00:16:43.800 --> 00:16:45.430
Complete nothingness,

00:16:45.470 --> 00:16:49.260
devoid of light, and even the
passage of time has halted.

00:16:49.300 --> 00:16:51.930
This is how the world ends.

00:16:51.970 --> 00:16:55.380
A world which has reached
the end of time.

00:16:55.430 --> 00:16:59.300
People may struggle all they like,
but the outcome will not change.

00:17:00.010 --> 00:17:02.180
Surely even you understand this.

00:17:02.220 --> 00:17:05.260
Hope and possibility are nothing
but fleeting dreams

00:17:05.300 --> 00:17:07.680
glimpsed at the doorstep
of this nothingness.

00:17:07.720 --> 00:17:10.510
Illusions that offer no comfort.

00:17:10.550 --> 00:17:15.550
They lead people astray and
create meaningless conflict.

00:17:15.590 --> 00:17:18.550
It is Newtypes who know this truth.

00:17:18.590 --> 00:17:19.930
Even so...

00:17:19.970 --> 00:17:23.050
One shouldn't place
unwarranted hope in life

00:17:23.090 --> 00:17:26.010
that merely exists and then fades away.

00:17:26.050 --> 00:17:27.050
Even so!

00:17:38.680 --> 00:17:42.010
Heat... Warm light...

00:17:43.380 --> 00:17:47.880
Gather up as much of this
as you like, it will change nothing.

00:17:48.430 --> 00:17:51.090
Yes. Nothing at all!

00:17:53.300 --> 00:17:57.340
This heat warms
the universe, doesn't it?

00:17:58.090 --> 00:18:00.010
I suppose it's time.

00:18:00.050 --> 00:18:03.180
Yes, I think you've let them
know enough of those thoughts

00:18:03.220 --> 00:18:05.630
you had when you were you, Captain.

00:18:26.050 --> 00:18:27.260
This light, it's...

00:18:43.470 --> 00:18:46.220
I entrust it to you.

00:18:46.680 --> 00:18:48.880
That which you believe you have to do.

00:18:50.630 --> 00:18:51.550
Banagher!

00:18:55.220 --> 00:18:57.760
Mr. Riddhe, Magallanica
is being targeted!

00:18:57.800 --> 00:19:00.340
This whole sector is in danger!
Contact them, hurry!

00:19:00.380 --> 00:19:01.590
What? Banagher!

00:19:12.720 --> 00:19:14.510
Are you sure?

00:19:14.550 --> 00:19:17.380
Let's leave the rest to them.

00:19:21.680 --> 00:19:23.340
Wait!

00:19:23.380 --> 00:19:26.050
Do you really intend to fire
with the Nahel Argama still there?

00:19:26.430 --> 00:19:29.260
Damage to the colony will
be kept to a minimum.

00:19:29.300 --> 00:19:30.220
But they're- -

00:19:30.260 --> 00:19:32.930
This is to protect
the Federation's interests.

00:19:33.260 --> 00:19:38.260
There are times when you must sacrifice
the few so the many might live.

00:19:38.300 --> 00:19:42.220
Surely a military man such
as yourself understands that.

00:19:44.130 --> 00:19:45.680
You're wrong.

00:19:45.720 --> 00:19:48.300
What's being protected is
the Foundation's interests.

00:19:50.180 --> 00:19:52.720
"Sacrifice the few so
the many might live."

00:19:53.010 --> 00:19:56.220
One of Father's favorite sayings.

00:19:56.470 --> 00:19:59.430
I couldn't live with that.

00:19:59.470 --> 00:20:02.430
That's why I sided with you!

00:20:02.470 --> 00:20:04.090
Why are you doing this?!

00:20:11.720 --> 00:20:16.800
You always said you rejected
the logic of men, so why?!

00:20:21.180 --> 00:20:22.130
Let me go!

00:20:22.180 --> 00:20:26.180
Aunt Martha, I know you heard
that voice, too! That was- -

00:20:27.130 --> 00:20:29.760
You're exhausted, Alberto.

00:20:34.180 --> 00:20:36.760
Report from System's fire control HQ.

00:20:37.300 --> 00:20:40.720
95% of operational
critical output reached.

00:20:40.760 --> 00:20:42.090
Chairman Ronan.

00:20:42.130 --> 00:20:44.180
Standing wave forming
smoothly within...

00:20:44.220 --> 00:20:46.340
If you insist on carrying out this act,

00:20:46.380 --> 00:20:49.300
I will be an enemy of the Federation
from this moment onwards.

00:20:50.680 --> 00:20:52.630
Spare me your bluffs.

00:20:52.680 --> 00:20:55.340
You have a family, too.

00:20:55.380 --> 00:20:58.510
Are you sure you want to drag
your children into this?

00:20:59.380 --> 00:21:04.050
I only want to be a father whose
children aren't ashamed of him.

00:21:09.760 --> 00:21:12.930
Chassis maintaining firing attitude
via gyro-stabilizing rotation.

00:21:13.630 --> 00:21:15.590
Minor adjustment of attitude control

00:21:15.630 --> 00:21:17.590
fully shifted
to angular velocity stabilizers.

00:21:22.010 --> 00:21:23.130
Execute.

00:21:26.340 --> 00:21:30.630
System here. Approval code
for firing order received.

00:21:30.680 --> 00:21:34.050
Power transmission from all
generator satellites shows green.

00:21:34.930 --> 00:21:39.340
Automatic tracking in progress.
Final targeting adjustment...

00:21:40.840 --> 00:21:43.550
Ensign Riddhe is there!

00:21:43.680 --> 00:21:46.970
Correcting for beam deviation
due to relativistic effects...

00:21:47.010 --> 00:21:49.840
The Banshee's pilot is Ensign Riddhe!

00:21:49.880 --> 00:21:53.300
I approved his request!

00:22:00.340 --> 00:22:01.840
Why?

00:22:03.510 --> 00:22:05.510
Why are you there?

00:23:38.220 --> 00:23:41.590
Next time, on Mobile Suit Gundam Unicorn

00:23:41.630 --> 00:23:42.970
RETURN

00:23:45.010 --> 00:23:48.180
awaken the Newtype that lies within you.
